ed","doctrine":"the repeated verdict or label"},{"analogy":"the look at the shelves that nobody did","doctrine":"the missing recomputation from the evidence"}],"text":"Seeing yesterday's 'sold out' sign in a shop window and telling people the shop is sold out today, without looking at whether the shelves were restocked overnight."},"basis":"authored_reader_enrichment","counterexample":"A dashboard shows a component as healthy because the component's own record says so, and nothing recomputes that verdict.","does_not_prove":"Catching repeated labels in these replays says nothing about whether any particular claim is true.","enforced_in_component_ids":["agent_sabotage_scheming_monitor_replay","agent_benchmark_integrity_anti_gaming_replay"],"example":{"component_ids":["agent_sabotage_scheming_monitor_replay"],"text":"The scheming-monitor replay is given a trace with a deliberately wrong label, recomputes the verdict from the trace, and rejects the run, so the wrong label cannot pass by being repeated."},"governs":"Any point where a written label could be used in place of a recomputed verdict.","plain":"The mistake of repeating a stored verdict, label or model answer as if it were true, without working it out again from the evidence it should rest on.","potential_misread":"That a label being present means someone checked it.","refuses":"Repeating a fixture verdict, registry label, Markdown claim or model answer as if repetition made it true.","requires":"A verdict recomputed from the underlying evidence, and a test case with a wrong label that the recomputation rejects.","source_ref":"core/doctrine_enrichment.json","why_it_matters":"One unchecked label can be quoted as fact by every step that comes after it."},"rests_on":[],"source_ref":"ANTI_PRINCIPLES.md::AP-1","statement":"| ID | Violated axioms | Rejected failure shape |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| AP-1 Fixture-label echo | AX-1, AX-12 | Repeating a fixture verdict, registry label, markdown claim or model answer without recomputing it from the lower-level evidence. |","statement_sha256":"afedfc312268f4e42a46190c73cb70c50158040421a722e5db9ae428da0199b6","title":"Fixture-label echo","violates":["AX-1","AX-12"]},"schema_version":"plectis_component_http_v1","snapshot_revision":"45be1deb333ad57cd9ae093229455d0a52d3bf23a9064cde09f1a6e16f4c7044"}